# T_SCRE: a delete the server refuses fetches nothing, one of a record
# already gone fetches the page again.  The seventh request, the item
# list's first page as shown, is answered as it was before another
# session deleted item 99.  The location Attic holds a location and item
# 1 holds parts: both refusals leave the page as it was, so the location
# list keeps the rows the server sent and the item list keeps row 99.
# Del on item 99 is answered 200, and the page fetched again has no row
# 99.
K HOME DEL
T Y
S LOCREF
K ESC HOME DEL
T Y
S ITEMREF
K DOWN DEL
T Y
S ITEMGONE
K ESC
